{"schemaVersion":2,"type":"languages","id":"csharp","latest":"2026-10-04","ranges":{"recent":{"start":"2026-09-28","end":"2026-10-04","count":5,"sources":4},"4w":{"start":"2026-09-07","end":"2026-10-04","count":10,"sources":6},"12w":{"start":"2026-07-13","end":"2026-10-04","count":17,"sources":6}},"projects":[{"url":"https://github.com/shanghaiyangming/lighttranslate","tags":["hellogithub","submission"],"title":"[开源推荐] 轻译：按快捷键即可划词翻译的 Windows 小工具","author":"shanghaiyangming","github":{"url":"https://github.com/shanghaiyangming/lighttranslate","name":"shanghaiyangming/lighttranslate","forks":0,"stars":0,"topics":["csharp","deepseek","dictionary","open-source","productivity","translation","windows","winforms"],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"https://shanghaiyangming.github.io/lighttranslate/","language":"C#","pushedAt":"2026-10-03T09:42:14Z","createdAt":"2026-10-03T07:41:07Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-03T09:42:17Z","openIssues":0,"description":"轻译：Windows 划词翻译与英语查词工具，支持 DeepSeek、自带 API Key、流式译文和全局快捷键。MIT 开源。","snapshotDate":"2026-10-03","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":1},"summary":"轻译是一个用 C# 和 Windows Forms 实现的桌面翻译工具。选中网页或文档中的可复制文字，按 Ctrl+Alt+Q，鼠标旁就会出现中文译文；英文单词和短语还可查看音标、用法、例句与词源。用户自行填写 DeepSeek API Key，软件免费，API 按用量计费。提供 Windows 安装包与便携 EXE，适合日常英文阅读和查词。 亮点 聚焦选区阅读：全局快捷键和鼠标旁浮窗，减少复制到聊天窗口再切回的操作。 翻译和查词分流：程序判断短英语候选与长文本模式，结果不符合模式时最多自动纠正一次。 C# 原生桌面实现，仅依赖 Windows/.NET 系统库，无 NuGet 依赖；可以学习 WinForms、剪贴板、全局热键、SSE 流式处理与 DPAPI 加密。 用户自己的密钥在本机加密保存，原文直连用户设置的 API 服务商，不经过项目中转服务；不保存翻译历史。 MIT 许可证，完整中文指南、英文介绍、本地自检与模拟 API 测试，可直接下载 Windows x64 安装版。 本人是项目作者，此次为自荐；使用 Codex 开发。当前为 v1.0.0，欢迎试用和反馈。 下载： 运行要求：Windows 10/11 x64、.NET Framework 4.8、可用 API 额度。模型生成的音标和词源可能不准确，不支持图片 OCR。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/521xueweihan/HelloGitHub/issues/3845","siteLogo":"https://img.devtrends.site/images/4f2fe7a3f11295d5d10fa015f65cd552a14d1fd78070ba071e89c98313d5faf0.svg","sourceId":"hellogithub-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/shanghaiyangming","githubUrl":"https://github.com/shanghaiyangming/lighttranslate","externalId":"3845","sourceName":"HelloGitHub·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-10-03T08:11:16Z","sourceIds":["chinese-indie-dev","hellogithub-issues","weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_cdca7dd5b3da66248760eeb8","projectPath":"/projects/shanghaiyangming/lighttranslate/","trendDate":"2026-10-03","taxonomy":{"languages":["csharp"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/zion-sati/netwasm","tags":["ruanyf-weekly","submission"],"title":"【工具自荐】NetWasm：C# 编译到 WASM，Hello World 只要 82.5 KiB","author":"zion-sati","github":{"url":"https://github.com/zion-sati/NetWasm","name":"zion-sati/NetWasm","forks":1,"stars":88,"topics":["compiler","csharp","dotnet","wasm"],"license":"NOASSERTION","archived":false,"homepage":"www.netwasm.com","language":"C#","pushedAt":"2026-10-01T12:07:57Z","createdAt":"2026-08-10T10:46:35Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-02T14:14:31Z","openIssues":29,"description":" NetWasm rebuilds .NET for WebAssembly - because cramming .NET Core into Wasm doesn’t make it a WASM platform.","snapshotDate":"2026-10-02","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"NetWasm 是面向 WebAssembly 和 WASI 的独立 .NET 编译器和运行时。编译器前端用 Roslyn 把 C# 编译成 CIL，再由 NetWasm 把 CIL 编译成 Wasm。CoreLib 和运行时也是独立实现，最终产物不依赖 CoreCLR 或 Mono，也不带 dotnet.js 和独立应用 DLL。 想做的事很简单：保留 C# 的泛型、异常处理和自动内存管理，同时让程序只带上实际用到的部分。 体积实测 同样是 Console.WriteLine(42)，两种编译方案的结果如下： | 编译方案 | 未压缩 Wasm 体积 | | --- | ---: | | NetWasm | 82.5 KiB | | .NET 11 RC1 Blazor WebAssembly AOT | 14.58 MiB | 后者约为前者的 181 倍。NetWasm 的数字已经包含运行时和精确 GC；Blazor 这边用 Release 发布，开了完整裁剪、AOT 后 IL 剥离，以及面向体积的编译和链接优化。 这里比的是同一段输出逻辑在两种技术栈下的 Wasm 体积。NetWasm 输出的是 WASI 组件，Blazor 这边统计的是浏览器实际加载的原生 Wasm 和 Webcil 程序集；两边都不含 JavaScript、HTML 和 Wasm 宿主。 完整测试配置与复现说明 不止 Hello World 也做了一个可以直接用的应用：Regex Storm with NetWasm。 它用的是 .NET 自己的正则表达式引擎，编译成 Wasm 后在浏览器里提供匹配、捕获组查看、替换和分割，不是拿 JavaScript 正则模拟。Wasm 文件经 Brotli 压缩后约 325 KB，不含页面其他资源。正则和待处理文本都在本地处理，不上传后端，整个应用可以部署成静态网站。 另外还有 NetWasm Playground，可以直接编辑、编译、运行 C#。编译也在浏览器本地完成，不会把代码提交到服务器，不用先装工具链。 当前状态 项目还没到 1.0，兼容性仍在完善。采用闭世界编译，通用运行时反射是明确不支持的设计取舍，不是以后要补的功能。 许可方面，CoreLib、运行时库和模板等是 MIT 许可；编译器和开发工具用 NetWasm Community License，源码可看，但不是 MIT。 中文介绍：嫌 .NET Wasm 太大？我重写了编译器和运行时 欢迎拿实际用的 C# 代码来试，反馈兼容性问题。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/12036","sourceId":"weekly-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/zion-sati","githubUrl":"https://github.com/zion-sati/netwasm","externalId":"12036","sourceName":"阮一峰周刊·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-10-02T12:54:19Z","sourceIds":["weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_25e6fa930d11666ff1aeda06","projectPath":"/projects/zion-sati/netwasm/","trendDate":"2026-10-02","taxonomy":{"languages":["csharp"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/rayrensx/iphonemirror","lang":"C#","tags":["hellogithub","official","C#"],"title":"iPhoneMirror","author":"","github":{"url":"https://github.com/RayrenSX/iPhoneMirror","name":"RayrenSX/iPhoneMirror","forks":60,"stars":901,"topics":["airplay","audio-capture","cpp","csharp","direct3d11","dotnet","h264","ios","ipad","iphone","libusb","low-latency","media-foundation","obs","obs-studio","quicktime","screen-mirroring","usb","windows","wpf"],"license":"GPL-3.0","archived":false,"homepage":"https://github.com/RayrenSX/iPhoneMirror/releases","language":"C#","pushedAt":"2026-09-28T06:46:00Z","createdAt":"2026-07-11T05:03:35Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:59:50Z","openIssues":12,"description":"Local Windows iPhone/iPad mirroring over USB and AirPlay with D3D11 preview, multi-device sessions, OBS output, and a standalone driver manager.","snapshotDate":"2026-09-28","defaultBranch":"main"},"metrics":{},"summary":"Windows 上的 iPhone 投屏工具。这是一款 Windows 本地投屏工具，可通过 USB 或 AirPlay 传输 iPhone/iPad 画面和声音，支持多设备、独立窗口、截图、OBS、蓝牙鼠标和键盘控制。","sourceId":"hellogithub-issue","authorUrl":"","githubUrl":"https://github.com/rayrensx/iphonemirror","externalId":"126-iPhoneMirror-https://github.com/RayrenSX/iPhoneMirror","sourceName":"HelloGitHub·月刊推荐","publishedAt":"2026-09-28T00:00:00+08:00","sourceIds":["hellogithub-issue"],"productId":"prd_4d37fab6bc53ea6fc7796a15","projectPath":